      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just \"weight\" though. it feels permanent. like no matter what I do, the math just never works out. i've tried every \"step\" people suggest but the hole just gets deeper. i feel like everyone around me is just living these normal lives and i'm just... stuck in this loop of failing. i feel like a burden to everyone who tries to help. it'd honestly just be easier if i could just stop feeling like this.",
