      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say that, but it doesnt change the fact that the situation is hopeless. it's like a wall. no matter how much i run, i just hit the same wall. sometimes i just sit here and think about how much simpler everything would be if i just wasn't here to deal with it. if the \"loop\" just stopped. it feels like the only way to actually get peace is to just exit the situation entirely.",
